A string whose YAML plain form would reload as a different type is written single-quoted.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
---
# My Plan
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md note="hello: world"
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 ---
 title: My Plan
+note: 'hello: world'
 ---
 # My Plan
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: note=hello: world
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
note: 'hello: world'
---
# My Plan
